      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract plain text from a scanned document image, I can use the Amazon Textract service, which is a powerful OCR (Optical Character Recognition) tool provided by AWS. I will write the Python code for the file `extract_text.py` that uses the Amazon Textract client to perform text extraction. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the `boto3` library and the use of the `textract` client. </thinking>\n",
